    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[WPPConnect patch release: v2.4.7]]></title>
        <id>https://wppconnect.io/blog/wppconnect/v2.4.7/</id>
        <link href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wppconnect/v2.4.7/"/>
        <updated>2026-11-26T16:55:03.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Today we are releasing a patch version v2.4.7 for WPPConnect with Bug Fixes, Tests, Build System, Continuous Integration and Chores.]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Today we are releasing a patch version v2.4.7 for WPPConnect with Bug Fixes, Tests, Build System, Continuous Integration and Chores.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="247-2026-11-26"><small>2.4.7 (2026-11-26)</small><a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wppconnect/v2.4.7/#247-2026-11-26" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 247-2026-11-26" title="Direct link to 247-2026-11-26" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="bug-fixes">Bug Fixes<a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wppconnect/v2.4.7/#bug-fixes" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Bug Fixes" title="Direct link to Bug Fixes" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li class="">deliver the QR code from wa-js events and reload expired codes (#2987) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/commit/cdf293c" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">cdf293c</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/issues/2987" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#2987</a> <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-server/issues/2722" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">wppconnect-server#2722</a> <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/issues/3815" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">wppconnect-team/wa-js#3815</a> <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/issues/3816" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">wppconnect-team/wa-js#3816</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="tests">Tests<a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wppconnect/v2.4.7/#tests" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Tests" title="Direct link to Tests" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li class="">verify package entrypoint imports before startup (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/commit/75857b9" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">75857b9</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="build-system">Build System<a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wppconnect/v2.4.7/#build-system" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Build System" title="Direct link to Build System" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>deps-dev:</strong> update dependency release-it to ^21.1.3 (#2984) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/commit/fe00eea" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">fe00eea</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/issues/2984" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#2984</a></li>
<li class=""><strong>deps:</strong> update dependency axios to ^1.21.1 (#2976) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/commit/1e92b37" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">1e92b37</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/issues/2976" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#2976</a></li>
<li class=""><strong>deps:</strong> update dependency sanitize-filename to ^1.6.5 (#2978) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/commit/31ee0e3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">31ee0e3</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/issues/2978" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#2978</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="continuous-integration">Continuous Integration<a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wppconnect/v2.4.7/#continuous-integration" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Continuous Integration" title="Direct link to Continuous Integration" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>deps:</strong> update dependency node to v24.22.3 (#2983) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/commit/73f7c29" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">73f7c29</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/issues/2983" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#2983</a></li>
<li class=""><strong>publish:</strong> stage npm releases for maintainer approval (#2985) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/commit/7a889be" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">7a889be</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/issues/2985" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#2985</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="chores">Chores<a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wppconnect/v2.4.7/#chores" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Chores" title="Direct link to Chores" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>deps:</strong> update @wppconnect/wa-js to 4.8.5 (#2988) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/commit/7557108" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">7557108</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/issues/2988" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#2988</a></li>
</ul>
<p>For more information, see the <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wppconnect/releases/tag/v2.4.7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">release page</a>.</p>]]></content>
